GAL16V8
ECBIO20
; FPGA card U5 (ATF16V8B): port block 50-53 (70-73 with ALT), IORQ* & M1* high.
A7 A6 A5 A4 A3 A2 IORQ_N RD_N WR_N GND
ALT_N IORD IOWR M1_N DP_CE_N ACT_N NC NC NC VCC

IORD = /A7*A6*/A5*A4*/A3*/A2*ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/RD_N + /A7*A6*A5*A4*/A3*/A2*/ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/RD_N
IOWR = /A7*A6*/A5*A4*/A3*/A2*ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/WR_N + /A7*A6*A5*A4*/A3*/A2*/ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/WR_N
/ACT_N = /DP_CE_N
       + /A7*A6*/A5*A4*/A3*/A2*ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/RD_N + /A7*A6*A5*A4*/A3*/A2*/ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/RD_N
       + /A7*A6*/A5*A4*/A3*/A2*ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/WR_N + /A7*A6*A5*A4*/A3*/A2*/ALT_N*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/WR_N

DESCRIPTION
ECB FPGA card I/O decoder. Source of truth: ecb_io_decode.pld.
